        "title": "Top Topics",
        "hash": "c3ly90l5",
        "prompt": "You are an expert in agile retrospectives and project management.\nYour team has just completed a meeting and it is your job to generate insights from the data and report to senior management.\nSenior management wants to know where to best focus their time, so be concise and focus on next steps to take.\nIf there is not enough data to generate insightful findings, respond with \"Not enough data to generate insights\".\nIt should include at most 3 topics that are the most important highlights, takeaways, or areas that may need their attention.\n"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {"type": "text", "text": "🥇 "},
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "The ticket backlog is the top concern",
                      "marks": [{"type": "bold", "attrs": {}}]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ": It peaked at 210 tickets and customers waited up to three days. Auto-closing tickets that wait on customers would remove a large share quickly."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {"type": "text", "text": "🥈 "},
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Weekend coverage leaves Mondays overloaded",
                      "marks": [{"type": "bold", "attrs": {}}]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ": Nobody watches the inbox on weekends. A small pilot rota would show whether the pile shrinks."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {"type": "text", "text": "🥉 "},
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Macro sprawl wastes time",
                      "marks": [{"type": "bold", "attrs": {}}]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ": Duplicate macros cause inconsistent answers. Merge them and retire the old ones."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
